* Non-smoker or occasional smoker ( ie \< 3 cig/day)

Exclusion Criteria:

* HIV or HBV infection
* Cirrhosis or Liver decompensation
* Chronic liver disease non related to HCV","healthyVolunteers":false,"sex":"ALL","minimumAge":"18 Years","maximumAge":"65 Years","stdAges":["ADULT","OLDER_ADULT"]},"contactsLocationsModule":{"centralContacts":[{"name":"Pr. Michel Doffoel, MD, PhD","role":"CONTACT","phone":"03 69 55 04 82","email":"michel.doffoel@chru-strasbourg.fr"},{"name":"Pr. Thomas BAUMERT, MD, PhD","role":"CONTACT","phone":"03 68 85 37","email":"thomas.baumert@unistra.fr"}],"overallOfficials":[{"name":"Dr Samira Fafi-Kremer, Pharma D, PhD","affiliation":"Laboratoire de Virologie PTM- Nouvel Hôpital CivilHôpitaux Universitaires de Strasbourg","role":"STUDY_DIRECTOR"},{"name":"Dr Catherine Mutter, MD","affiliation":"Centre d'investigation Clinique -P1002Nouvel Hôpital CivilHôpitaux Universitaires de Strasbourg","role":"STUDY_CHAIR"},{"name":"Dr François Habersetzer, MD, PhD","affiliation":"Service d'Hépato-Gastro-Entérologie - Nouvel Hôpital CivilHôpitaux Universitaires de Strasbourg","role":"STUDY_CHAIR"},{"name":"Dr. Thomas BAUMERT, MD, PhD","affiliation":"Service d'Hépatogastroentérologie, NHC1, place de l'hôpital - BP n°42667091 STRASBOURG CEDEX","role":"STUDY_DIRECTOR"}],"locations":[{"facility":"Service d'Hépatogastroentérologie, NHC1, place de l'hôpital","city":"Strasbourg","state":"Alsace","zip":"BP n°426","country":"France","contacts":[{"name":"Pr. Michel DOFFOEL, MD, PhD","role":"PRINCIPAL_INVESTIGATOR"}],"geoPoint":{"lat":48.58392,"lon":7.74553}}]}},"derivedSection":{"miscInfoModule":{"versionHolder":"2026-09-28"},"conditionBrowseModule":{"meshes":[{"id":"D006526","term":"Hepatitis C"}],"ancestors":[{"id":"D000086982","term":"Blood-Borne Infections"},{"id":"D003141","term":"Communicable Diseases"},{"id":"D007239","term":"Infections"},{"id":"D006525","term":"Hepatitis, Viral, Human"},{"id":"D014777","term":"Virus Diseases"},{"id":"D018178","term":"Flaviviridae Infections"},{"id":"D012327","term":"RNA Virus Infections"},{"id":"D006505","term":"Hepatitis"},{"id":"D008107","term":"Liver D